        (ModularCurve.qExpFunctionFieldC ℚ (CongruenceSubgroup.Gamma1 M)))))
      ↥(ModularCurve.laurentBaseChange ℂ (ModularCurve.qExpFunctionFieldC ℚ
        (CongruenceSubgroup.Gamma1 M))) =
